    "sentence_translations": [
      "(14) What Is It?",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo’s family didn’t forget her birthday.",
      "",
      "“Duoduo, look, this is for you!” Mom said.",
      "",
      "“What is it?”",
      "",
      "“Movie tickets for Titanic. How about we go to watch it this Saturday at 5 o’clock in the evening, just the two of us?",
      "Last time we agreed that the two of us would go to see a movie,” Mom said.",
      "",
      "“Big sister, big sister! Big sister!” Listen to me,” her little brother said.",
      "",
      "“What do you want to say?” Qian Duoduo asked.",
      "",
      "“I also have something to give you,” her little brother said.",
      "",
      "“What thing?” Qian Duoduo asked.",
      "",
      "“Come, come! Look at the table,” her little brother said.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo looked on top of the table. There was nothing there.",
      "Qian Duoduo looked under the table. There was a cute thing under the table. What was it?"
    ]
